From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:22:18 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 40/42] BlueOS: jelly bends the scene with the weather; a jelly
 drag owns the gesture

The moving jelly was drawn from the plain picture over the weather: the haze vanished in its areas while they moved
(the glass widgets over them looked broken). Now the scene is drawn through the jelly as a RenderEffect.
A finger that comes down on a jelly area and moves takes the gesture, like patting the character: no shade,
bouncer, page swipe, all apps or long press (lock screen: shade window; home: DragLayer with blueos_wall_jelly_view).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5fe9830016a216956df97ab267535d2e5e744f31
